","Percentages are of revenue; figures may not sum due to rounding."],"report":{"summary":["Eagle Bancorp Montana is the holding company for Opportunity Bank of Montana, which provides banking services to individuals and businesses. Revenue (net interest income plus noninterest income) rose 12.8% to $91.6M in 2025. Net interest income rose 14.9% to $72.9M and noninterest income rose 5.0% to $18.7M; noninterest expense rose 3.2%, and the provision for credit losses was $1.2M, versus $518K.","Net income rose 51.7% to $14.8M, or $1.90 per diluted share, and the efficiency ratio was 78.1% versus 85.3%. Eagle Bancorp Montana returned $6.2M through dividends and buybacks."],"highlights":["Revenue rose 12.8% to $91.6M.","Net interest income rose 14.9%.","Noninterest income rose 5.0% to $18.7M.","Net income rose 51.7% to $14.8M."],"watch":["Credit-loss provision rose 2.3× to $1.2M.","Net loans fell 0.1% to $1.5B.","Net interest income depends on interest rates.","Noninterest expense was $71.5M, up 3.2%."],"table":[["Total revenue",0.0916,0.0812,1],["Net interest income",0.0729,0.0634],["Noninterest income",0.0187,0.0178],["Noninterest expense",0.0715,0.0693],["Provision for credit losses",0.0012,0.0005],["Pre-tax income",0.0189,0.0114,1],["Income tax",0.0041,0.0016],["Net income",0.0148,0.0098,1],["Diluted EPS ($)",1.899999,1.239999,0,"eps"],["Book value per share ($)",24.548022,22.236868,0,"eps"]],"sources":[["Eagle Bancorp Montana, Inc. Form 10-K filings (SEC EDGAR)","https://www.sec.gov/cgi-bin/browse-edgar?action=getcompany&CIK=0001478454&type=10-K"],["Eagle Bancorp Montana financial statements (StockAnalysis)","https://stockanalysis.com/stocks/ebmt/financials/"]]},"video":{"revenueLine":{"cap":"Net interest income was 80% of revenue.","say":"Net interest income made up 80 percent of revenue."},"spotlights":[{"kicker":"Revenue","big":"$91.6M","sub":"revenue · +12.8%","lines":["Net interest income $72.9M","Noninterest income $18.7M"],"cap":"Revenue rose 12.8% to $91.6M."